WEBVTT

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:23.870
Ouch!

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.380
I'm leaving now.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.920
I'm leaving now!

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:25.430
Mysteria Friends

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:31.730
Anne & Grea

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.330
Are we having potions class for first period today?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.490
Oh, that looks yummy!
I thought first period was holy magic and healing magic...

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:43.700
I thought first period was holy magic and healing magic...

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.000
With Ms. Miranda?

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.290
Hey, who are you going to pick as your roommate?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.920
I'm not sure yet.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.130
Oh, it's the princess!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.300
Good morning!

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.350
Good morning!

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.430
Morning!
Top of the morning.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:03.930
Good morning.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:04.470
Morning.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.390
Greetings.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:06.390
Morning!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:06.980
Good morning.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:07.600
G'morning.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.310
Good morning.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.440
Have a wonderful day.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.040
Grea!

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.370
Good morning!

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.870
So this is where you were!

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.460
G-good morning.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.340
Thank you.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.800
Um... Princess Anne?

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.600
Jeez, you're a Dragonborn princess yourself,
so don't be so formal.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.140
Just call me "Anne"!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.350
A-N-N-E!

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:55.900
Anne...

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.860
Yeah! What is it?

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.370
The book that we went to borrow the other day...

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.700
The one I recommended to you?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.120
Yeah.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.750
I haven't finished it yet, but...

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.460
The Kingdom of Mysteria...

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.710
Learning more about it and you
is really fun for me... Thanks.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.840
I'm so glad!

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.470
The library here is split into
a bunch of different languages,

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:30.100
and there's so many books to choose from,
you just wanna read them all!

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.640
Y-yeah.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:36.110
Actually, earlier I saw a book all about
the country that Dragonborns come from.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.650
What is it like there, Grea?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.490
Um...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.660
The animals we have are a lot bigger
than the ones over here, I guess.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.670
Oh yeah? That sounds really neat!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.960
So, what made you come to this school?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.170
Um... this is my mother's alma mater.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.050
I'm half dragon and half human, so...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.640
Oh? So your mother was a student here, too!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:11.850
Huh?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.560
Anne!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.230
Hup!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.860
Hey, Anne!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.570
Lou?!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.370
Are you okay?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.010
Oh, Anne! Thank you so much!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.340
There's trouble at the library! Please come quick!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.050
Huh? W-wait!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:52.390
Sorry, Grea! Just wait for me!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.230
O-okay...

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.910
How did this happen?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.620
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.460
Hanna! Are you okay?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.290
Princess?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.210
I'm so sorry I stepped on you!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.180
Everybody, stand back!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:33.930
The princess is amazing!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.100
She saved us!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.190
Is it all right if I seal it up?

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:40.650
Y-yes...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.610
Okay!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.380
Eisbein!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.190
I'm sorry.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.810
It's okay.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.120
None of this is your fault, Princess.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:37.500
I'm the one who asked you to seal
the library's guardian.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.750
But you were just...

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:46.010
I wasn't able to handle the situation on my own.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.090
I'm not really cut out to be the class president.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.970
I'm not strong enough.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.180
It's pathetic.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.100
I'm a failure.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.440
Thanks for your help.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.820
Um...

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.820
If there's anything else that I can help with...

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.910
You've done more than enough for today.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.160
Thank you so much, Princess.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.800
Gr-

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.180
Grea?!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.060
Anne.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.900
Um...

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.280
Did you take care of it?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.450
Y-yeah.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.110
Though everything got covered in ice after I sealed it.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:17.950
Huh?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:22.620
Oh! The guardian of the library was upset,
and it caused a big scene.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.250
That's why...

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.340
I stayed to help everyone deal
with the aftermath, but...

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.550
But I was...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.640
You did your best.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:58.740
Were you waiting for me this whole time?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.040
Yeah...

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.090
But... you kept me waiting too long...

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.460
I think.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.760
What's wrong?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.680
Oh, nothing.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.720
Are you hungry, Anne?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:28.190
Oh, I guess I haven't had anything since breakfast.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.020
Let's go get something to eat.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.030
Yeah!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.950
Which flavor do you prefer, sweet or spicy?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.410
Sweet...

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.960
I knew it!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.080
Me too!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 2
Agony of Grea

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:41.010
Mysteria Friends, episode 2: "Agony of Grea."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:45.970
Illustration by Naoyuki Onda

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.980
My name is Owen, 17 years old.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.980
I am an esteemed paladin of this kingdom.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.120
I had been charged with guarding the palace,

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.370
